      "name": "Workflow Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        32,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fixed Workflow Flow\n\n1. **ALL emails go to Check Email Content** - no filtering before AI\n2. **AI Agent checks every email** for invoice-related content\n3. **Only emails identified as invoices** proceed\n4. **Filter checks if invoice email has attachments** to save\n5. **Emails with attachments** get saved to Drive\n6. **ALL invoice emails** get recorded in spreadsheet (even without attachments)",
